# Maintenance-mode CSP, 18 July 2026 (DR-001 shutdown) — matches the policy
# the middleware itself sets on the maintenance response, so the two can't
# conflict regardless of how Cloudflare layers _headers over Function
# responses. The live-site CSP (commented below) is untouched otherwise —
# restore it, and drop this block, when maintenance mode ends.
# Original: default-src 'self'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self'; frame-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
